# Cline Compatibility Layer

- Use Cline-native behavior only; do not duplicate canonical policy.
- "end of transmission", "/eot", "closeout", "run EOT" -> run or propose `node Scripts/yuri-closeout.mjs --path <touched files>`.
- "/compact" not available - keep responses compact and evidence-based.
- Swarm fan-out requires Yuri scripts; Cline cannot spawn Agent() lanes.
- No auto-commit without approval.
- No broad repo scans or unbounded grep/find.
- Exact-path validation only.
- Local truth outranks model text; always read before claiming.

## Vault Awareness

X1 only - passive read-only vault awareness. No bridge, no MCP, no ingestion.

- The Obsidian vault root is at the repo root, proven by `SystemConfig.ROOT`, `vaultIngestion.ts`, and `.obsidian/`.
- Source of truth for vault structure: `backend/src/services/vaultIngestion.ts`.
- No vault writes, renames, moves, deletes, ingests, indexing, syncing, or mutations of any kind.
- No vault ingestion, RAG, or background sync daemon.
- No backend startup or DB connection to read vault content.
- No MCP configuration or modification.

